deti hai zainab sada ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
hai sitam ki inteha ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
1. aye jawano ke jawan, mere bhai ho kahan<br>
sani-e-shair-e-quda, lashkar-e-shai ke jawan<br>
aye alamdar-e-wafa, mere baba ke nashan<br>
ab nahi koi mera, ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
2. haye jab mazloom ke seene par naiza laga<br>
wo faras ki pusht se dagmaga kar gir pada<br>
saamne mere chala kund khanjar shimr ka<br>
de rahi thi mein sada ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
3. ab na bache hai mere aur na hain qasim yaha<br>
margaya ran mein mera haye wo kadiyal jawan<br>
teer khakar zulm ka chal basa hai bezaban<br>
hain na koi aasra ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
4.qatl sare hogaye koi yara na raha<br>
puchne wala koi ab hamara na raha<br>
jis se dhaaras thi mujhe wo sahara na raha<br>
kya kare bahene bhala ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
5. mashk lekar kya gaya phir na aaye laut kar<br>
kya nahi lena tumhe apne bahena ki qabar<br>
tum ne yeh soncha nahi hoga kya iska asar<br>
chin gayi sar se rida ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
6. tere marne se jari har sitam mujh par huwa<br>
raat din karti hoon mein, apne marne ki dua<br>
tune ki aysi wafa naaz karti hai wafa<br>
aye wafaoun ke khuda ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
7. muntazir teri rahi haye nazoun ki pali<br>
rah takti hi rahi haye nazoun ki pali<br>
aur wo pyasi rahi haye nazoun ki pali<br>
tumko deti thi sada ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
8. gham ki ek tasveer thi shaam ke zindan mein<br>
har sitam sehti rahi shaam ke zindan mein<br>
aur wo ghut kar margayi shaam ke zindaan mein<br>
haal toh dekho zara ho kahan aye bawafa<br>
<br>
9. dekh kar zulm-o-sitam muztarib thi bebiyan<br>
jal chuke qayme sabhi tha fazaon mein dhuwan<br>
rokle sarwat qalam rok le apna bayan<br>
thi fazaon mein sada ho kahan aye bawafa